# 4_nitroaniline.msf
# 4-Nitroaniline (para-nitroaniline)
# pKa=1.000 (4-NO2-C6H4-NH3+ → 4-NO2-C6H4-NH2, q=+1→0)
# Source: Perrin 1981
# Strongly electron-withdrawing nitro group drops aromatic amine pKa
# from 4.60 (aniline) to 1.00 — a 3.6 pKa unit effect.
# Completes the aromatic amine series: 4-NO2 (1.0), none (4.6), 4-Me, 4-OMe.
# Δq_N will be distinct from both aliphatic ammonium and simple aniline.

